<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3239] unicode characters in an iPython paragraph makes Spark interpreter irrsponsive</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3239</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;An unicode characters in an iPython paragraph makes Spark interpreter irresponsive.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To reproduce, type into a new %ipyspark code following phase (yes, it&apos;s not a valid python code but the imprtant part is that it has a long unicode dash character ):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
One following unicide character makes ipythonInterpreter not responding to Cancel commands &#8211;&#160;&#160;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;DEBUG interpreter log shows following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;DEBUG &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2018-02-15 00:39:45,628&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; ({pool-2-thread-2} IPythonClient.java&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;stream_execute&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;:87) - stream_execute code:&lt;br/&gt;
