&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Notice&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&quot;Process Output: UnicodeEncodeError: &apos;ascii&apos; codec can&apos;t encode character u&apos;\u2013&apos; in position 91: ordinal not in range(128) &quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So iPython interpreter breaks on presence of any unicode data.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12910693/12910693_Zeppelin-iPython_para_with_Unicode.PNG&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

